-- Mekgineer Thermaplugg (Gnomeregan): every Jackhammer releases three Walking Bombs about 20 yards from him (the kit
-- links them to the Jackhammer row, rev_20260930_00). Each bomb fixates a random player, walks slowly towards them
-- and explodes on arrival (Walking Bomb Effect 11504, Normal 1000 / Heroic 3850 / Mythic 5000 in 10 yards).
-- Bomb health: Heroic ~15.4k, Mythic ~20k (Ascension, ingame check 02.10.2026). 03.10.: half the speed (0.3), they
-- explode within 6 yards of their player (3 yards was not reached reliably).

